  partName: Engine Block Mounting Plate
  description: The Engine Block Mounting Plate is a tiny, thin-flat component positioned
    at the bottom-center-front of the engine, made of Material.005, which provides
    excellent strength and durability. Its primary function is to serve as a mounting
    point for the engine block, enabling secure attachment to the engine's chassis
    and ensuring optimal engine performance. Notably, the plate's design allows for
    flexibility in engine mounting configurations, making it a critical component
    in the engine's overall design and installation.
